X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  As the semester has come to an end\, the Offic
 e of Equity and Inclusion invites faculty and staff to reflect on the aca
 demic year\, relax\, and build community with a year end sound bath and m
 editation opportunity.<br />\n  <br />\n  The session will be led by <a h
 ref="https://crownandhearthealing.com/">Laura Yee of Crown &amp\; Heart H
 ealing</a>\, on May 20 from 2:30–4:00 p.m. in Gregg Pavilion. Space is 
 limited\, RSVP if you would like to attend!\n</p>
END:VEVENT
