SUMMARY:Summer Book Club Kick Off
DESCRIPTION:The Office of Equity and Inclusion aims to provide spaces to 
 build community with faculty and staff through the summer. This book club
  serves as an opportunity to meet and discuss topics related to trauma\, 
 resilience\, and survivorship. We will come together to discuss the autho
 r and their story and how it impacts our understanding of our society so 
 we can learn and grow to strengthen our campus community and student expe
 rience.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Office of Equity and Inclusion aims
  to provide spaces to build community with faculty and staff through the 
 summer. This book club serves as an opportunity to meet and discuss topic
 s related to trauma\, resilience\, and survivorship. We will come togethe
 r to discuss the author and their story and how it impacts our understand
 ing of our society so we can learn and grow to strengthen our campus comm
 unity and student experience.</p>
