DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260618T133000
LOCATION:Lower Estate Gardens
GEO:45.450083;-122.668673
SUMMARY:Employee Appreciation Picnic
DESCRIPTION:RSVP's are required by Friday\, June 5. Please fill out the f
 orm below if you plan to attend.  Contract employees and summer student w
 orkers MUST also register to attend.  In honor of the World Cup returning
  to the U.S.\, our theme this year is celebrating the spirit of the globa
 l game–fútbol!  Wear your favorite jersey/comfortable footwear and joi
 n us for food\, leisure\, and lawn games.  The event will be located at t
 he lower estate gardens (https://map.lclark.edu/?id=2086#!ct/70889\,73849
 ?m/796452?s/estate). If the weather decides to misbehave\, we will reloca
 te to Stamm (Fowler Student Center\, third floor).Celebrate your hard wor
 k at L&amp\;C! RSVP now for this global fútbol-themed employee picnic in
