SUMMARY:LC Alumni of Puget Sound: Cheer on the Everett Aquasox\, with a p
 regame tailgate and postgame fireworks
DESCRIPTION:It is also Retro Bobblehead Night and a number of other fun m
 inor league baseball activities. Family friendly—bring your friends and
  family.  We'll meet before the game in the parking lot for a tailgate mi
 xer starting at 5:30 p.m. (games start at 7:00 p.m.).There will be more i
 nfo later on tickets\, etc.  If you have questions\, or are interested in
  events in the Puget Sound area but are unable to attend this month\, ple
 ase contact Merrilee MacLean at merrileemaclean@gmail.com (mailto:merrile
 emaclean@gmail.com)  To get the latest information and see pictures from 
 past events\, feel free to check out theLewis &amp\; Clark Alumni of Puge
