SUMMARY:Save the Date! July 13! Empowering Local Climate Action: Educatio
 n\, Policy and Practice
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by John Doerr's Speed &amp\; Scale: An Action Plan f
 or Solving Our Climate Crisis Now\, we will enjoy panels and workshops fo
 cused on:  Electrifying Transportation  Decarbonizing the Grid and Infras
 tructure  Fix Food  Protect Nature  Clean Up Industry  Remove Carbon from
  the Atmosphere  Enjoy a key note at 5:30 pm.
