 cale: An Action Plan for Solving Our Climate Crisis Now\, we will enjoy p
 anels and workshops focused on:</p><p>  Electrifying Transportation</p><p
 >  Decarbonizing the Grid and Infrastructure</p><p>  Fix Food</p><p>  Pro
 tect Nature</p><p>  Clean Up Industry</p><p>  Remove Carbon from the Atmo
 sphere</p><p>  Enjoy a key note at 5:30 pm.</p>
