X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>Join the Office of Equity and Inclusion for our su
 mmer book club read\, the memoir <em>Know My Name</em> by Chanel Miller. 
 This will be our wrap up event\, where we discuss the entire book\, and c
 ollaborate on ways we can have continued dialogues about these themes on 
 campus.&#160\;&#160\;</p>
