 h="760" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></picture> Dawn Montgomery\
 , EdD</strong> is a change facilitator and insightful thought partner. Sh
 e supports leaders from a wide variety of fields\, including educators\, 
 nonprofit executives\, and community administrators as they find their wa
 y in challenging times. Assisting humans in their discovery and reconnect
 ion to their deepest longings has been a passion for many years. Her back
 ground in K-12 and college education as teacher\, principal\, and distric
 t leader support her coaching practice and team facilitation. She believe
 s transformation is born when a circle of humans sit together to listen\,
  to speak their deepest truths and to share their wildest imaginations fo
 r the world. She is expert at holding space for both individual leaders a
 nd teams as an executive coach\, conflict mediator\, equity-focused profe
 ssional developer and a certified Courage &amp\; Renewal facilitator. She
  is committed to making a difference in the lives of individuals and thei
 r communities.</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\;"><strong><picture class="l
 w_image lw_image95419 lw_align_right"><source type="image/webp" srcset="h
