DESCRIPTION:It's time to step away from the billable hours and the briefs
 . The Lewis &amp\; Clark Law reunions are back\, and we're rolling out th
 e red carpet for the "6" years. If this is your class\, grab your classma
 tes and come and join us!  This year\, we're excited to offer a fun and f
 amily-friendly event so bring the whole family! We're exploring bringing 
 a bounce house and food trucks to campus. And as always\, you can count o
 n a campus tour provided by a current law student and for the law booksto
 re to be open so you can gear up with your River Otter merch!&#160\;RSVP 
 HERE (https://engage.lclark.edu/register/?id=0c1dd8ce-c23c-4221-9d3c-1fa9
 c532c571)  Your classmates are currently working on behind the scenes on 
 a "Class Specific" activity – here is what has been planned so far:1976
         Date: Saturday\, August 22              Time: 4–8:30 p.m.      
         Location: Blueberry Hills Estate              AND              Da
 te: Saturday\, October 17              Time: 12–2 p.m.              Loc
 ation: Blueberry Hills Estate      1986        Date: TBD              Tim
 e: TBD              Location: TBD      1996        Date: TBD             
  Time: TBD              Location: TBD      2006        Date: TBD         
      Time: TBD              Location: TBD      2016        Date: Saturday
 \, October 17              Time: 6–8 p.m.              Location: Steepl
 ejack (2nd floor)      Do you want to help plan? Email lawalum@lclark.edu
  (mailto:lawalum@lclark.edu).  We look forward to seeing you!
