SUMMARY:2026 Animal Law Conference
DESCRIPTION:You've got plans! The 34th annual Animal Law Conference\, co-
 presented by Animal Legal Defense Fund &amp\; Center for Animal Law Studi
 es is happening October 16-18\, 2026\, in Washington\, DC. Save the date 
 and stay tuned for more details soon!  Interested in presenting? Speaker 
 proposals are being accepted now through March 15\, 2026. Submit your pro
 posal here (https://www.animallawconference.org/call-for-proposals/).
